OL,3,GNEWSAUK faces worst decade for
OL,4,Ahousehold incomes, IFS think tank says,
OL,5,Aas it warns debt and growth problems
OL,6,Aremain
OL,7,
OL,8,FThe UK faces the "worst decade for
OL,9,Fhousehold income growth on record",
OL,10,Faccording to the head of the
OL,11,Finfluential Institute for Fiscal
OL,12,FStudies (IFS) think tank
OL,14,FHelen Miller says "no amount of
OL,15,Ftemporary cost of living packages"
OL,16,Fannounced in the Budget will fix that -
OL,17,Fand warns big debt and growth problems
OL,18,Fremain
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,428,420,260,160,0,100
