OL,3,GNEWSAUK faces worst decade for
OL,4,Ahousehold incomes, IFS think tank says,
OL,5,Aas it warns debt and growth problems
OL,6,Aremain
OL,7,
OL,8,FIt comes after the head of government
OL,9,Fspending watchdog the Office for Budget
OL,10,FResponsibility (OBR) warned the
OL,11,Fcountry's economic outlook is a "pretty
OL,12,Fgrim picture"
OL,14,FChancellor John Healey delivered his
OL,15,Ffirst Budget as chancellor on Wednesday
OL,16,F- he tells the BBC the government "can
OL,17,Fnever remove completely the cost of
OL,18,Fliving pressures that people feel"
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,428,420,260,160,0,100
