OL,3,GNEWSAUK faces worst decade for
OL,4,Ahousehold incomes, IFS think tank says,
OL,5,Aas it warns debt and growth problems
OL,6,Aremain
OL,7,
OL,8,FHealey announced a range of measures,
OL,9,Fincluding a #100 energy payment for 20
OL,10,Fmillion households in England and tax
OL,11,Frises on some savings and rental
OL,12,Fprofits - a quick guide to the policy
OL,13,Fannouncements
OL,15,FThe Conservatives have criticised the
OL,16,Fchancellor's "disjointed" Budget, while
OL,17,Fthe Lib Dems say we need closer ties
OL,18,Fwith Europe "so we can grow and
OL,19,Ftherefore cut people's taxes"
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/3
